    means: >-
      One request a client sends the MCP service, as text. The service
      answers each message on its own.
  - term: reply
    means: >-
      The text the MCP service sends back in answer to one message —
      any answer, success or failure. There is exactly one reply per
      message, and a Scenario reads it as the whole answer, character
      for character: it is what the Operator watches to judge the
